msgstr "Darbība pārtraukta."

#: dnf/cli/cli.py:239
msgid ""
"This bootc system is configured to be read-only. Pass --transient to perform "
"this transaction in a transient overlay which will reset when the system "
"reboots."
msgstr ""
"Šī bootc sistēma konfigurēta kā tikai lasāma. Norādiet --transient, lai "
"veiktu šo transakciju īslaicīgā pārklājumā, kas tiks atiestatīts, sistēmai "
"pārstartējoties."

#. Only tell the user about the transient overlay if
#. it's not already in place
#: dnf/cli/cli.py:247
msgid ""
"A transient overlay will be created on /usr that will be discarded on "
"reboot. Keep in mind that changes to /etc and /var will still persist, and "
"packages commonly modify these directories."
msgstr ""
"Uz /usr tiks izveidots pagaidu pārklājums, kas pārstartējot tiks atmests. "
"Ņemiet vērā, ka izmaiņas /etc un /var saglabāsies, un pakotnes šīs "
"direktorijas bieži maina."

#: dnf/cli/cli.py:260
msgid ""
"This operation would modify the following paths, possibly introducing "
"inconsistencies when the transient overlay on /usr is discarded. See the "
"usr_drift_protected_paths configuration option for more information."
msgstr ""
"Šī darbība mainītu šos ceļus, un, atmetot īslaicīgo pārklājumu uz /usr, var "
"rasties nekonsekvence. Plašāka informācija — konfigurācijas opcijā "
"usr_drift_protected_paths."

#: dnf/cli/cli.py:267
msgid ""
"Operation aborted. Pass --setopt=usr_drift_protected_paths= to disable this "
"check and proceed anyway."
msgstr ""
"Darbība pārtraukta. Norādiet --setopt=usr_drift_protected_paths=, lai "
"atspējotu šo pārbaudi un tomēr turpinātu."

#: dnf/cli/cli.py:272
